Package: kilix-engine
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: libegl1, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: libcanberra0
Description: terminal engine for Kilix
 The Kilix build of the kitty terminal emulator, which Kilix runs as its
 rendering and terminal engine. Everything is installed under
 /usr/lib/kilix/engine: nothing is placed on PATH, and the package can be
 installed beside Debian's kitty.
